+    # re-ask that existed before this rule is sent unchanged.
+    #
+    # It can leave a paying answer standing or move it to
+    # insufficient_information; in 16 sampled re-asks it never refused. Its
+    # known cost: option (a) is rarely taken. A broken wrist from a fall and a
+    # policy "renewed every year since 2019" were both moved to
+    # insufficient_information. Listing (a) last instead was measured and is
+    # worse: those two still moved and the gallbladder did not.
+    if not problems and verdict in (Verdict.COVERED, Verdict.CONDITIONAL):
